Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Remove the Open Anaconda Prompt here menu entries for the current user.
; Double-click this file in File Explorer and confirm the registry import.
; A minus sign before a registry key deletes that key and its subkeys.
; Only the two AnacondaPromptHere keys created by the setup file are targeted.
; This does not uninstall Anaconda or delete environments or project files.
; It removes these entries rather than restoring any previously customized
; values at the same keys. No installation path changes are needed here.

; Remove the entry for right-clicking a folder and its command subkey.
[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\Directory\shell\AnacondaPromptHere]

; Remove the entry for right-clicking empty space inside a folder.
[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\Directory\Background\shell\AnacondaPromptHere]

